<title>USA: Insilco Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Insilco Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    profit	    $0.86     loss	 $0.15</p>
<p> Net    profit	    8,500     loss	 1,600</p>
<p> Sales		    142,900		  137,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,900		   10,300</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr    profit   $2.67	    profit$0.18</p>
